Package: master
Title: Multivariate Axonal Simulator for Tractography Evaluation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aymeric", "Stamm", , "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654"))
Description: Simulation of white-matter bundles (fascicles) and
    microstructural attributes for diffusion MRI tractography. Implements
    the FDA-based generative model of the MASTER design: a centerline
    reference pathway is assembled from a flat central interaction segment
    with smooth bending arms,
    reparametrized by curvilinear arc length, and perturbed by zero-mean
    functional random fields of axons expressed in a B-spline basis with
    exponentially autocorrelated Gaussian coefficients. Emits
    fiber::bundle objects ready for interactive visualization with
    'rtists'.
